  "private": true,
  "description": "PiTavern — 基于 @earendil-works/pi-ai 的四阶段快慢双轨 RPG 交互引擎（PreRouter → ContextAssembler → Actor → PostEvaluator）",
  "type": "module",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20.0.0"
